#ASSERT (`charge under s 377BB(7)` `Voyeurism 377BB(7) via 1 a`)'s `made out`
#ASSERT (`charge under s 377BB(7)` `Voyeurism 377BB(7) via 1 a`)'s section EQUALS "377BB(7)"
